# Patterns without **/ only match at the context root, so nested folders need **/
# Dependencies and build output: the image installs and builds its own (Linux) copies,
# a host node_modules / .next would overwrite them with Windows binaries
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Secrets stay out of the image; the compose file passes the environment
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Not used by the API or web at runtime
.git
.vscode
Docs
